#: browser/README.md:block 1 (header)
msgid "Using Ceno Browser"
msgstr "使用Ceno浏览器"

#: browser/README.md:block 2 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"This chapter gives you some hints on the usage of Ceno Browser as far as its "
"Ouinet-related capabilities are concerned. Please always keep in mind that "
"Ceno is based on [Firefox for Android][Firefox for Android], so for all "
"questions on generic browsing topics you should refer to Mozilla's [Firefox "
"for Android Support][Firefox for Android Support] pages."
msgstr ""
"本章为您提供了一些关于 Ceno 浏览器 Ounet 相关功能的用法提示。请始终记住，"
"Ceno 基于 [Firefox for Android][Firefox for "
"Android]，因此有关通用浏览主题的所有问题，您应该参考 Mozilla 的 [Firefox for "
"Android 支持][Firefox for Android 支持] 页面。"

#: browser/README.md:block 3 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"When relevant, screen captures will be included to illustrate the text. "
"Please note that these may slightly differ from what you see on your device, "
"especially as Ceno development progresses. This documentation is up to date "
"for Ceno version 1.6.0."
msgstr ""
"如果相关，将包含屏幕截图以说明文本。请注意，这些内容可能与你在设备上看到的内"
"容略有不同，尤其是在 Ceno 开发过程中。本文档是 Ceno 版本 1.6.0 的最新版本。"

#: browser/README.md:block 4 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"If your application exhibits behaviors substantially different from those "
"described here, do not hesitate to contact us at [cenoers@equalitie.org]"
"(mailto:cenoers@equalitie.org) and report the issue."
msgstr ""
"如果您的应用程序表现出的行为与此处描述的行为大不相同，请随时通过 "
"[cenoers@equalitie.org]（mailto:cenoers@equalitie.org） "
"与我们联系并报告问题。"

#: browser/README.md:block 4 (paragraph)
msgid "[Firefox for Android]: https://www.mozilla.org/firefox/android/"
msgstr "[Firefox for Android]: https://www.mozilla.org/firefox/android/"

